 # Perform:
 # - Launch sqlsetup downloader injected by the ADD verb ( Need >$NULL because in quiet mode, this action wait for the user press enter )
-# - Launch generated SQLEXPR_x64_ENU.exe to extract setup tools
+# - Download the Express with Advanced Services media: Full-Text Search is not
